{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Treat a missing configured base directory as permanent.** `NoSuchFileException` while traversing a missing base-path component reaches this retryable fallback, so `RetrySerDes` repeatedly delays for a pre-provisioning/configuration error. Distinguish base-directory traversal failures from a missing payload file, wrap the former in `SerDesException`, and update the missing-base test accordingly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pAy6d","finding_digest":"2bcf2603b3ee182ca49fe665229af7f411781ad670ee09834d6704a357ee1a07","finding_id":"arf_v1_fphsma5t5ymczje74zssfgxx6q","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::opensecuredirectory::symlink-retry-classification","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::opensecuredirectory::symlink-retry-classification","line":348,"observation_digest":"be80083d6c741302124c608a2faae261b95a02fa6bb5990d7ec2bc22bde2788d","observation_id":"aro_v1_x2aaqplmoqjqeesmmcfc7kxcmg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_fphsma5t5ymczje74zssfgxx6q","published_at":"2026-09-01T23:20:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hoszbnsyb5dus6uvdwmmh6rr7w","reviewed_base_sha":"d8ed0d4a55bafe23a7f2c1fb71f66204097dda95","reviewed_head_sha":"3e353306c1b8ea5bfae1cd97b720923d2032a491","reviewer":"codex","start_line":348,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_buew7ufihm6o2c2od6qefkvfet","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T23:20:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
